specular-jxl
===========

The decoder in this crate (src/bitstream, src/coding, src/color, src/common, src/frame,
src/grid, src/image, src/modular, src/oxide, src/render, src/threadpool, src/vardct) is an
in-tree fork of jxl-oxide 0.12.6 and its component crates (jxl-bitstream, jxl-coding,
jxl-color, jxl-oxide-common, jxl-frame, jxl-grid, jxl-image, jxl-modular, jxl-oxide,
jxl-render, jxl-threadpool, jxl-vardct):

    jxl-oxide - https://github.com/tirr-c/jxl-oxide
    Copyright (c) Wonwoo Choi and the jxl-oxide contributors
    Licensed under either of the MIT licence (LICENSE-MIT) or the Apache License,
    Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE), at your option.

Modifications for Specular: the crates were flattened into one, all `unsafe` code was
replaced by safe equivalents, architecture-specific SIMD paths were removed in favour of
portable / autovectorisable code, and an 8-bit sRGB output layer with fused downscaling, DC
previews and animation compositing was added (src/lib.rs). The modifications are
distributed under the same terms.
